Super hot weather.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.500
No widespread football infrastructure.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.420
And perhaps most strikingly,

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:02.400
not a huge tradition of football

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.340
or even a significant local population

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.260
to spread football to in their place.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.880
Like they have a couple
hundred thousand people.

