No one's gonna remember
every little detail.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.020
That's not the point.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:41.130
The point is to give you a
sampling of the mechanics

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.500
of how influence and power works.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.910
Not just in FIFA, but in the
international system generally.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.530
How powerful people get what they want.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.830
We'll never know for certain
because this vote was secret.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.530
But we know Qatar got 14 of these guys.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.360
And I think I have a
