00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.560
Like smoking gun evidence.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.970
Same thing happened to this guy,

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.610
the executive committee member
from the Oceania region.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.920
And they actually got
