from their different countries

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.890
and then saying that they're gonna liaise

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:22.470
with the CEO of the gas company

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:25.170
to follow up about a
liquid natural gas sale.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.210
I mean, it's just so clear
