chapter of the story.

00:27:18.960 --> 00:27:22.380
What happens after Qatar
gets hold of the World Cup

00:27:22.380 --> 00:27:24.780
and they have to build
all this infrastructure.

00:27:24.780 --> 00:27:27.090
And it's a very long, intense journey

00:27:27.090 --> 00:27:29.280
